  "name": "Tactical Acumen",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your Second Wind feature, you can choose one of the following additional effects:</p><ul><li>You can move up to half your Speed without provoking Attacks of Opportunity.</li><li>If you are under the effect of the Dodge action, you also have Advantage on Strength and Constitution Saving Throws for its duration.</li><li>If you are under the effect of the Dash action, you can make a single weapon attack with a weapon you are holding.</li></ul>",
